' ========================================
' File Loading Flow
' ========================================
note as FileLoadingFlow
    **File Loading Flow:**
    1. User opens file
    2. FileLoaderService.get(file) → FileLoader
    3. FileLoader.load() → Container
    4. ContainerFactoryService.get() → ContainerFactory
    5. TreeNodeFactoryService builds tree
    6. PanelFactoryService creates panel
    7. Display in MainTabbedPanel

    **Decompilation Flow:**
    1. Select .class entry in tree
    2. TypeFactory extracts Type
    3. PanelFactory creates JavaFilePage
    4. Fernflower decompiles bytecode
    5. Display source in RSyntaxTextArea
end note

